 * via the GUI or CLI. Run CLI with '--help' for additional information on how to override these arguments.
 * @cliArgs --device "F28P65x" --part "F28P65x_256ZEJ" --package "256ZEJ" --context "CPU1"
 * @v2CliArgs --device "TMS320F28P650DK" --package "256ZEJ" --variant "TMS320F28P650DK9" --context "CPU1"
 * 
